      "score": 84,
      "summary": "Strong structure and verification boundary. Some runtime consequences are labeled [Observed], such as hover movement and drag lagging behind the pointer, which overstates static evidence. It handles drag ownership and grab offset well. Interruption starts from the rendered position but does not hand off velocity. Velocity projection is mentioned only briefly, with no units and no velocity passed into the settle. Reduced Motion and the validation plan are good."
    },
