        "performance": 9,
        "velocity_projection": 13
      },
      "score": 92,
      "summary": "Thorough, well-labeled findings, though the 'Predicted experience' line about how it will feel leans toward runtime claims. It covers direct manipulation fully. It samples the live pose before canceling and handles stale completions. Velocity estimation includes signed velocity, decay after a pause, projection, snap selection and spring handoff, but units are not stated. It notes that a CSS-only Reduced Motion override won't stop the explicit animation. Transform ownership is addressed less explicitly than in A."
